name: ['Brave the Elements', 'Clever Impersonator', 'Courser of Kruphix', 'Dispel', 'Eerie Interlude', 'Eidolon of the Great Revel', 'Eldrazi Displacer', 'Ethereal Armor', 'Fiery Impulse', 'Kozilek, the Great Distortion', 'Mana Confluence', 'Matter Reshaper', 'Mutavault', 'Nykthos, Shrine to Nyx', "Nylea's Presence", 'Reflector Mage', 'Rending Volley', 'Satyr Wayfinder', 'Shaman of the Pack', 'Sliver Hivelord', 'Soldier of the Pantheon', 'Thought-Knot Seer', 'Wastes', 'World Breaker', 'Zulaport Cutthroat']
